# Arquivo de exemplos para o REST Client (VS Code)
# 1) Cadastre um usuário
# 2) Faça login e copie o token retornado
# 3) Cole o token em @token
# 4) Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = cole_o_token_aqui
@userId = 1
@taskId = 1

############################################
# USERS
############################################

### Cadastro de usuário (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login — copie o campo "token" da resposta e cole em @token (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@email.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Listar todos os usuários (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar usuário por ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar o próprio usuário (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@email.com",
  "password": "654321"
}

### Deletar o próprio usuário (DELETE)
# Cuidado: isso também apaga as tarefas do usuário (Cascade)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

############################################
# TASKS  (todas precisam de token)
############################################

### Criar tarefa vinculada ao usuário do token (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Node.js",
  "description": "Revisar Fastify, pg e JWT"
}

### Listar somente as tarefas do usuário logado (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar uma tarefa por ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar uma tarefa (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Node.js (atualizado)",
  "description": "Incluir testes das rotas no REST Client"
}

### Deletar uma tarefa (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
